p=page('SRS functional requirements for tracking','2.4 Functional requirements FR-01 to FR-04')
table(p,'Tracking requirements retaining MST identifiers',['ID','Required final behavior','Verification'],[['FR-01','Register local accounts, verify BCrypt credentials, establish one session and sign out without deleting data.','UC-01; T01-T02; validators A04-A05.'],['FR-02','Create, view, edit, delete, search and filter account transactions. Amount is positive and scale <=2; expense date is not future. Editing preserves original type.','UC-02/03/04; T03-T07; A06-A07.'],['FR-03','Offer system/custom categories and category totals. Reject blank or duplicate custom names within visible categories/type.','UC-04; T08; category test exists but not run.'],['FR-04','Set monthly expense-category budgets; calculate spending utilization; show default warning at >=80% and exceeded at >=100%.','UC-05; T09-T10; BudgetServiceTest exists, not run.']],[.13,.61,.26])
sub(p,'Acceptance boundaries')
text(p,'FR-01 does not include forgotten-password recovery, email verification or server authentication. Usernames accept a restricted character set with a demo exception. Password strength beyond minimum length is not enforced. Financial-data separation primarily relies on user-scoped UI queries and updates; not every DAO lookup takes a user ID.',
'FR-02 accepts descriptive payment modes, optional notes and date/category/type/amount/keyword filters. Invalid amount-filter text currently disables that bound rather than producing a warning. Future income dates are not rejected by the income validator. Budget warnings are informational; overspending is not blocked.',
'FR-03 categories have a type and may be system-wide or account-specific. The final interface supports category creation, not a general category editing/deletion screen. FR-04 limits are unique per user/category/month; setting an existing combination updates the limit through SQL upsert.')
