stories=[('US-01','As an account holder, I want to register and sign in, so that I can access my local financial records.','FR-01; UC-01; T01-T02','Given valid unused credentials, registration opens the shell. Given wrong credentials, no session is created. Sign Out returns to login without deleting data.'),('US-02','As an account holder, I want to record income and expenses, so that I can review how money changes over time.','FR-02; UC-02; T03-T04','Positive two-decimal entries save with date, category and mode. Zero/negative amounts and future expenses are rejected. Saving updates the transaction table.'),('US-03','As an account holder, I want to correct or remove a transaction, so that my ledger reflects the actual event.','FR-02; UC-03; T05-T06','Editing locks type but permits other fields. Cancel does not save. Deletion requires confirmation and reloads the table.'),('US-04','As an account holder, I want custom categories and filters, so that I can locate specific spending.','FR-02/03; UC-04; T07-T08','Category name cannot be blank or duplicate. Filters return current-account records. Reset restores the unfiltered view.')]
